        "CopyrightInformation": "2014 BMJ Publishing Group Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "We present a case of paraneoplastic limbic encephalitis, describing the presenting features, diagnosis and management plan. Limbic encephalitis is one differential of rapidly progressive dementia. We describe a rational approach to the diagnosis of the patient with rapid cognitive decline."
